{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311490","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311490","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1631149001:1":{"text":"로렌스, 근데 저 사람 우리 보고 있는 거 아니야?","source_cn":"劳伦斯，那个人是不是在看我们啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52ECC04791FEB86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631149002:1":{"text":"신경 쓰지 마. 그냥 길을 잃었겠지. 난 네 마음속에서 길을 잃었고...","source_cn":"别管他，说不定只是个迷路的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9A6C5A34DEA286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631149003:0":{"text":"근데 계속 저기 있으면, 우리가 자리를 옮겨야 할 거 같아.","source_cn":"但要是他再待一会儿，我们可能就得换个地方了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BDE57CADED55F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631149004:1":{"text":"근데 아까 말하던 무도회 말이야...","source_cn":"……所以，你刚才说下周的舞会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0406F4393BFFBC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631149005:0":{"text":"무도회? 아, 맞아. 무도회... 다들 널 부끄럽게, 아니, 널 부럽게 만들도록 쫙 빼입을게!","source_cn":"啊？哦，对……舞会……我会准备好礼服的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E39D8CDC5CF3388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631149006:1":{"text":"이제 슬슬 우리 둘만의 시간을...","source_cn":"咳……要是只有我们两个就好了，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBA80B5C777E9E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1631149007:1":{"text":"안 돼! 저기... 저기 사람이 우리 보고 있잖아...","source_cn":"嘘！你小点声……别让人误会了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E9F8FF076EB5B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631149008:1":{"text":"네가 눈을 뜨고 있으니까 보이는 거야. 자, 눈 감아 봐. 아무것도 안 보이지? 그럼...","source_cn":"不会的，我说的是舞会。又不是说现在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE67B7414F940929B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631149009:1":{"text":"무슨 말도 안 되는 소리야! 됐고... 나 추워... 우리 도서관 근처에서 산책이나 하자.","source_cn":"那个，劳伦……这里好像有风，我有点冷了。我们……去图书...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41497191039669B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631149010:1":{"text":"도서관! 아주 좋지! 조용하고, 인적도 드물고...","source_cn":"好啊！图书馆好，又安静又……没人打扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C3F961C510BA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女学生":{"text":"여학생","source":"女学生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男学生":{"text":"남학생","source":"男学生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}